                            "jsDoc": "Read-write μs uint32_t. When set to value other than `0`, it asks the device to reset after specified number of microseconds.\nThis is typically used to implement watchdog functionality, where a brain device sets `reset_in` to\nsay 1.6s every 0.5s.\n* ```\nconst [resetIn] = jdunpack<[number]>(buf, \"u32\")\n```"
